Files in this directory come from, or are rendered from, AtlasOfLivingAustralia/spatial-service 3.1.0
(https://github.com/AtlasOfLivingAustralia/spatial-service, tag 3.1.0):

- layer.gsp, field.gsp: grails-app/views/manageLayers/*.gsp, copied unmodified.
- layer-new.html, layer-existing.html, field-new.html: the POST form of those views rendered with
  scripts/render-gsp.mjs and a sample model (see scripts/render-reference.sh).
- openapi.json: the OpenAPI document published by spatial-service 3.1.0 at /ws/openapi/openapi.json.

